msgstr "El router del fabric es accesible"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"El router puede estar caído, o tu endpoint es incorrecto — revisa de nuevo "
