#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**certificate**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Tu identidad es aceptada"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
"if needed"
msgstr ""
"Tu certificado puede estar caducado o rechazado — `goat profile show`, y "
